{"id": "65110", "title": "狐狸的秘密", "author": "颜月溪", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 31, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65110.htm", "intro": "黎小梨从来没想到自己会嫁给军人\r\n\r\n尤其是谢羽杨那样严肃、刻板、不爱说话\r\n\r\n除了会讨好她爷爷，一点也不可爱的怪人\r\n\r\n尽管她坚信：一切不以恋爱为基础的结婚都是耍流氓\r\n\r\n包办婚姻害死人\r\n\r\n可谁叫她出了那么一件“不光彩”的事\r\n\r\n自己闯的祸，可不得自己兜着\r\n\r\n本文甜、腻、嗲，情节忽悲忽喜，进度忽快忽慢，内容天马行空，人物异想天开，借用高干文的壳，记录一个女孩儿的成长故事，最大的优点就是不弃坑，最大的缺点是不能让所有人都满意，欢迎走过路过，不适应作者文风者也请自行绕道，散买卖不散交情，不喜欢还非要自虐的请于无人处自行了断，管杀不管埋。", "base": "files/article/html/65/65110", "chapters": [{"title": "归国", "file": "9692043.html", "available": false}, {"title": "重逢", "file": "9692045.html", "available": false}, {"title": "古玩", "file": "9692052.html", "available": false}, {"title": "禁闭", "file": "9692054.html", "available": false}, {"title": "拜寿", "file": "9692056.html", "available": false}, {"title": "豪宅", "file": "9692057.html", "available": false}, {"title": "耳环", "file": "9692060.html", "available": false}, {"title": "蹦极", "file": "9692062.html", "available": false}, {"title": "人祸", "file": "9692063.html", "available": false}, {"title": "求婚", "file": "9692064.html", "available": false}, {"title": "见面", "file": "9692065.html", "available": false}, {"title": "溜冰", "file": "9692066.html", "available": false}, {"title": "订婚", "file": "9692067.html", "available": false}, {"title": "别扭", "file": "9692069.html", "available": false}, {"title": "圣诞", "file": "9692071.html", "available": false}, {"title": "冷战", "file": "9692073.html", "available": false}, {"title": "挡横", "file": "9692075.html", "available": false}, {"title": "同游", "file": "9692077.html", "available": false}, {"title": "心思", "file": "9692079.html", "available": false}, {"title": "舞伴", "file": "9692081.html", "available": false}, {"title": "谎言", "file": "9692083.html", "available": false}, {"title": "面谈", "file": "9692084.html", "available": false}, {"title": "温暖", "file": "9692085.html", "available": false}, {"title": "VIP章节 1", "file": "9692086.html", "avail